   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The overview",
   "texto": [
    "A **sinopsis** summarizes the main argument without counting every detail. You can mention the scenario, the conflict and the culminating moment.",
    "**Berdasarkan** introduces the source of a story: **film berdasarkan kisah nyata** («film based on a real story»)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The meng- - i",
   "texto": [
    "In some words, **meng-...-i** makes a causal sense: **menakuti penonton** («to cause fear to the spectators»). In others, it points to an action aimed at a place: **mengunjungi desa** («visit a village»). The meaning depends on the word; do not translate the suffix in one way."
   ]
  },
